PASS: a provenance record keeps field, record, route, source (sheet, row, column), state, transformations and reasons
PASS: records are JSON-safe (NaN kept as the text "NaN") and frozen
PASS: a calendar date maps to UTC midnight of that day in any time zone (the engine reader's calDate rule)
PASS: absence and invalid dates are recorded explicitly, never as a number
PASS: Northstar direct: every X1 column is present
