PASS: FG003 (cost invalid): valuation withheld; quantity and availability stay available
PASS: unaffected items and supplier analysis are not withheld (no contamination)
PASS: a withheld calculation names the field, its state and the source row
PASS: the report line is specific to the affected field and names the dependent calculations; unaffected fields get no line
PASS: On_Order_Qty column removed: recorded once as column-absent
PASS: stock position depends on On_Order_Qty only when CFG.sup = 1 (default 0 uses purchase orders): design §8.2
PASS: physical available stock never depends on on-order; the PO reconciliation always does
PASS: withholding records use the gate's { withheld, reason } shape
PASS: Northstar FG001: complete; 12 slots aligned to the 12 calendar months
PASS: a missing middle month stays in place: slot 6 is "missing", slot 7 keeps its own month and value (no compression)
PASS: a blank cell is a missing slot with cause "blank" (its meaning, unknown or zero, is D6 and not applied)
PASS: no demand rows at all: "no-rows" (interim Q1), not "complete" and not zero history
PASS: every month recorded as 0: "recorded-zero", distinct from no-usable-history
PASS: every value invalid: no usable history, each slot keeps its cause
PASS: with rows but no usable value the forecast dependency is withheld; availability is not affected
PASS: with no demand rows at all the forecast dependency is withheld (D6 + Q1: unknown, not zero); availability unaffected

